7988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104867383", "author": {"steamid": "76561198256236046", "personaname": "Sawyer LaFleur", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198256236046/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 11708, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 231, "playtime_at_review": 5745, "last_played": 1787942044, "avatar": "9a635c988a661187cc13515b10604c24d3c8b7c5"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Excelente juego..........Lo recomiendo.", "timestamp_created": 1638293015, "timestamp_updated": 1638293015, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.515852093696594238", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104860342", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068626384", "personaname": "DM", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198068626384/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 5130, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2540, "last_played": 1642607858, "avatar": "9b6be160d5979611b604878dc192945c109f5d40"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Ok... ahora que me había acostumbrado a solo ver infectados especiales y jefazos, con el nuevo parche, les echo de menos, encima son más torpes y no aguantan nada.\n\nla ia de los bots es malísima así que si no tienes con quién jugar o aguantas a randoms o prepárate para respirar hondo más de una vez para no mandarles por ahí.\n\n¿ Hola? ¿ hay alguién que lo juegue aún? fuera coñas solo han puesto un minijuego de farmeo.\n\nPensaba que con los nuevos personajes venía una nueva campaña pero no... F", "timestamp_created": 1638290104, "timestamp_updated": 1650623127, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104850431", "author": {"steamid": "76561198182482943", "personaname": "Atoq", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/namelessbliss/", "num_games_owned": 133, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 1598, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1468, "last_played": 1640666672, "avatar": "f2eca8d585fdc2d0d5e7abd8c22437506a89642c"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Tiene algunos defectos (bots) y se esperaba más, pero es entretenido y cumple recordando al l4d", "timestamp_created": 1638285589, "timestamp_updated": 1638285589, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104781313", "author": {"steamid": "76561199031985810", "personaname": "black knight", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199031985810/", "num_games_owned": 316, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4759, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1335, "last_played": 1703390258, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "un excelente juego", "timestamp_created": 1638238294, "timestamp_updated": 1638238294, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104779488", "author": {"steamid": "76561198307324606", "personaname": "Renegada", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bluerrose/", "num_games_owned": 90, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 15502, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 178, "last_played": 1726860761, "avatar": "093d238056b3abf2cf1029ca847d6b2d8a0719d7"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es un buen juego para unas 500h; debido que aunque solo disponemos de los mapas que el propio juego trae..tenemos las variantes con las cartas, las dificultades y obviamente los randoms. Quizás su precio original sea un poco elevado, pero en los días de descuento si es una gran opción para plantear.\n\nTambién tengo que decir que el promedio de jugadores son poco cooperantes y prefieren ir todos como un animal irracional por los mapas y eso logra que ciertos mapas se atasquen incluso con las dificultades más bajas; quitando eso sigo pensando lo mismo que en el primer párrafo.", "timestamp_created": 1638236914, "timestamp_updated": 1639490150, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.512499988079071045", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "104779376", "author": {"steamid": "76561198434244583", "personaname": "HtnNw", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198434244583/", "num_games_owned": 282, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2175, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1784, "last_played": 1658032890, "avatar": "e371711ce8cc892365fdae31dd992230bbd17174"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Un juego que estuve esperando con muchas ansias y me haga sentir ese \"no se que\" de su antecesor L4D, pero no sé si el juego no es lo suficientemente bueno como superarlo o si simplemente soy yo y mi cariño por L4D que a tantos marco por la gran comunidad que nos recibió al entrar, por los amigos que hicimos, por las experiencias, risas y poca o nada de frustraciones debido su baja competitividad, gente que solo venía a divertirse, por esto y muchas cosas más fuimos impulsados a comprar este gran juego que lamentablemente no puedo apreciar lo suficiente como realmente quisiera... :,)", "timestamp_created": 1638236835, "timestamp_updated": 1638236835, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "104741085", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983401085", "personaname": "rulonator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197983401085/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 33689, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8752, "last_played": 1703406497, "avatar": "c8958489104a3a1fad01857aaa3702c6a77a47f4"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Juegazo!\n\nEdit 2022: Con las actualizaciones que han ido metiendo, es más juegazo todavía.\n\nNo hagáis caso a los disminuidos psíquicos que dicen que el juego es malo, y que utilizan al Left 4 Dead 2 para atacarlo, puesto que son los mismos que en su momento lo boicotearon.\n\nEs la la REPOLLA.", "timestamp_created": 1638212952, "timestamp_updated": 1669668864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_